WEBVTT

00:10:29.383 --> 00:10:30.717
It will take us all.

00:10:31.114 --> 00:10:33.760
But we do have an unprecedented
opportunity to try,

00:10:33.784 --> 00:10:38.255
and I believe we also, as adults,
have a responsibility to do this.

00:10:39.644 --> 00:10:41.636
And then when we're all asked,

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.279
"What do you do?"

00:10:43.303 --> 00:10:46.223
each and every one of us can say,

00:10:46.247 --> 00:10:48.374
"I'm changing the course of human history.

00:10:48.795 --> 00:10:52.195
I'm doing my bit to end
violence against children."

00:10:52.633 --> 00:10:54.847
Let's do this and do it now.

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:56.411
Thank you.

00:10:56.435 --> 00:11:02.230
(Applause)